  "src_typeComment": "Drop on any UI Graphic (Image, RawImage, ...) — clicking it fires an expanding \"shockwave\" ripple from the click point (Toolkit/UI/Ripple Distortion shader), both warping the sampled UV and pulsing a highlight along the ring. One ripple at a time: clicking again mid-ripple just restarts it at the new point, matching how most \"material ripple\" button effects behave (this is a UI polish effect, not a multi-ripple simulation).",
